    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loan 4117: 29% of contracts awarded and 44% disbursed as of 08 May 2025</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: As of December 2023, a total of 85 GAP trainings have been completed on Pomegranate, Orange, Strawberry, Okra, Chili, Custard Apple, Banana, flowers, Strawberry, Guava, Mango, Cashew, Sapota and lemon; a total of 16,677 farmers including 4,288 women. 47 matching grant subprojects sanctioned. Construction activities to upgrade the agriculture value chain facilities of Maharashtra State Agricultural Marketing Board are ongoing at 18 project locations and 6 have been completed.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
